// A factionless guard (neutral to the player) facing away; the player fires the pistol 800 uu
// behind it. The guard turns to the noise (React, then Investigate) and then sees the player
// standing there recovering from the shot. Does a neutral guard that did not see the shot being
// fired turn Busted on the player? The port's `criminal()` treats the pistol's Recovering phase
// (about 1.5 s) as a visible attack; the original's reaction list has no gunshot response
// (`DisTweaks_AIBrain_Reaction`: HurtByPlayer, DestroyWoB, Breakable_Broke, PlayerThreats
// (Harmless), WoL_ZapObject, Carry*Corpse, WitnessPickpocket).
//
// MOVED from the Playground to Boyle Ext (round 8): without a navmesh the original guard could not
// walk to the noise. Placement: the quiet flat navmesh corridor x = -8958, y -8871 .. -6671
// (floor z -1318), the same 800 uu geometry rotated to +y (yaw 90). No checkpoint changes.
(
    name: "ai/shot_in_view_of_neutral",
    system: Ai,
    map: "L_Boyle_Ext_P",
    description: "A neutral guard that turns around to the shot and sees the shooter recovering.",
    setup: (
        player: Some((position: (-8958, -8650, -1222), yaw: 90, pitch: 60, snap_to_floor: true)),
        items: ["Bullet:5"],
        left_hand: Some("Pistol"),
        npcs: [(id: Some("guard"), position: Some((-8958, -7850, -1218)), yaw: 90, state: Some("Idle"), faction: Some("None"))],
        settle: 120,
    ),
    ticks: 600,
    input: [(tick: 5, action: Press(Secondary))],
    checkpoints: [
        (name: "never fights", expect: [(metric: TimeAt("npc.guard.state", 9), value: 0, tol: 0, source: "a neutral pawn is only head-tracked toward the player (AI.md Factions / Attention); the reaction list has no response for a fired gun", status: Unverified)]),
        (name: "attention on the player stays below Busted", expect: [(metric: Max("npc.guard.attn_level"), value: 3, tol: 0, cmp: AtMost, source: "relationship Neutral: head-track only", status: Unverified)]),
    ],
    record: [Pawn, Npc("guard"), SimEvents],
    capture: Some("scenario boyle_hear_shot answers the same question on the original"),
)